{"3232560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hot Dog Simulator", "steam_appid": 3232560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your hot dog cart through the city streets, finding ideal locations to serve your hot dogs to hungry customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/560c562938cb035d8b0704a74b643fd0.poster.avif?t=1765359180\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/560c562938cb035d8b0704a74b643fd0.webm?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/560c562938cb035d8b0704a74b643fd0.mp4?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve up hot dogs to an increasing crowd of customers, as your stand becomes the go-to spot for a quick, delicious bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/038cfbfaba4c75219b042ebe1cb2ffa9.poster.avif?t=1765359180\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/038cfbfaba4c75219b042ebe1cb2ffa9.webm?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/038cfbfaba4c75219b042ebe1cb2ffa9.mp4?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve to high-profile customers and attend major events to maximize your sales and gain free publicity. Show off your best hot dog creations and watch your popularity grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/2b6f5be0956a143e8f3450e5fce0e1f6.poster.avif?t=1765359180\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/2b6f5be0956a143e8f3450e5fce0e1f6.webm?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/2b6f5be0956a143e8f3450e5fce0e1f6.mp4?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your business by hiring vendors to run multiple stands across the city. Collect your earnings and grow your hot dog kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/08067c64cf47a11e766fe29522b2ab22.poster.avif?t=1765359180\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/08067c64cf47a11e766fe29522b2ab22.webm?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/08067c64cf47a11e766fe29522b2ab22.mp4?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your hot dog cart through the city streets, finding ideal locations to serve your hot dogs to hungry customers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/560c562938cb035d8b0704a74b643fd0.poster.avif?t=1765359180\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/560c562938cb035d8b0704a74b643fd0.webm?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/560c562938cb035d8b0704a74b643fd0.mp4?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve up hot dogs to an increasing crowd of customers, as your stand becomes the go-to spot for a quick, delicious bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/038cfbfaba4c75219b042ebe1cb2ffa9.poster.avif?t=1765359180\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/038cfbfaba4c75219b042ebe1cb2ffa9.webm?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/038cfbfaba4c75219b042ebe1cb2ffa9.mp4?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve to high-profile customers and attend major events to maximize your sales and gain free publicity. Show off your best hot dog creations and watch your popularity grow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/2b6f5be0956a143e8f3450e5fce0e1f6.poster.avif?t=1765359180\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/2b6f5be0956a143e8f3450e5fce0e1f6.webm?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232560/extras/2b6f5be0956a143e8f3450e5fce0e1f6.mp4?t=1765359180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your business by hiring vendors to run multiple stands a